===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} A [[computerize]]d [[interactive]] [[system]] for [[storing]], [[processing]] and [[reproducing]] [[verbal]] [[message]]s left through a [[conventional]] [[telephone]] [[network]].
#: {{syn|en|voice mailbox}}
# {{lb|en|countable|by extension}} An individual message on such a system.
#: {{syn|en|voice message}}

